  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Amadeus State",
      "text": "<img src=\"assets/market-icon.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Amadeus state logo\">\n\n[简体中文](README.zh-CN.md) · [Detailed configuration](REFERENCE.md) · [Issues](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/amadeus-state/issues)\n\nShared Workspace state with persistent evolution history.\n\nTarget package: **`@fg-lab/amadeus-state@1.2.0`**. Tested runtime baseline: official DSH Desktop **0.2.1-rc.3**. MIT licensed."
    },
    {
      "section": "Release status",
      "text": "**1.2.0 is published:** [GitHub Release](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/amadeus-state/releases/tag/v1.2.0) · [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fg-lab/amadeus-state). Install the pinned version and verify the release checksum. Later main changes do not change this immutable archive. See [publishing policy](docs/PUBLISHING.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "What you can do",
      "text": "- Maintain mood, energy, curiosity and interest weights with persistent events and evolution history.\n- Bind a Workspace and configure supported Session overrides, exclusions and evolution rules.\n- Inspect current values, rules and stored history through the native DSH settings visualizations.\n\nExample: inspect an interest's current weight and event history, change an evolution rule, and verify the subsequent state update without rewriting long-term memories."
    },
    {
      "section": "What you can do",
      "text": "State represents current condition and change; Memory stores facts, experiences and long-term knowledge. It does not replace Persona's core identity. QQ-specific Scene rules and unavailable optional Memory-write contracts must not be assumed supported; consult the detailed reference for the implemented boundary."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install and configure",
      "text": "Install the prebuilt `.tgz` with the official DSH plugin manager into your selected Profile. No local source build is required. Follow [installation instructions](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md); do not copy configuration into a running Profile by hand.\n\nUse native DSH settings to choose a Workspace and inspect state and evolution rules.\n\nThe other Amadeus plugins are optional. Install only the integrations you need."
    },
    {
      "section": "Interface",
      "text": "This is a recorded interface screenshot, not evidence that every real platform capability passed the current release gate. See the detailed reference and verification reports for limitations."
    },
    {
      "section": "Upgrade and recovery",
      "text": "Back up user data before upgrading. Code, persistent user data and recovery backups are separate. Disable stops functionality; uninstall is intended to retain external data. Restoring old code alone does not reverse a database migration.\n\n- [Upgrade policy](docs/UPGRADE_POLICY.md)\n- [Data migration and recovery](docs/DATA_MIGRATION.md)\n- [Release checklist](docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md)\n- [Full configuration and limitations](REFERENCE.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Ecosystem and license",
      "text": "[Amadeus project](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/Amadeus-dsh) · [MIT license](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Amadeus State",
      "text": "<img src=\"assets/market-icon.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Amadeus state logo\">\n\n[English](README.md) · [详细配置参考](REFERENCE.md)\n\n工作区共享状态与持久化演化历史。\n\n目标发行包：**`@fg-lab/amadeus-state@1.2.0`**。已验证的官方 DSH Desktop 基线：**0.2.1-rc.3**。许可证：MIT。"
    },
    {
      "section": "当前发行状态",
      "text": "已发布 **1.2.0**：[GitHub Release](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/amadeus-state/releases/tag/v1.2.0) · [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fg-lab/amadeus-state)。请安装固定版本；发行包校验值见 Release。后续源码修改不代表该版本安装包发生变化。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能帮你做什么",
      "text": "- 保存情绪、精力、好奇心及兴趣权重，记录状态事件和演化历史。\n- 绑定工作区，设置已支持的会话覆盖、排除项与演化规则。\n- 在 DSH 原生设置可视化页面中检查当前值、规则及持久历史。\n\n示例：查看某项兴趣的当前权重与事件历史，调整演化规则，再观察后续状态变化，无需改写长期记忆。\n\nState 管理当前状态及变化，Memory 管理事实、经历和长期知识；State 不替代 Persona 的核心身份。不要将 QQ 专属场景规则或不可用的可选 Memory 写入契约当成已支持功能，具体边界见完整参考。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装与首次配置",
      "text": "使用官方 DSH 插件管理器将预构建 `.tgz` 安装到所需 Profile，无需手工构建源码。按[安装说明](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md)操作，不要手工改写正在运行的 Profile。\n\n在 DSH 原生设置中选择工作区，查看状态并配置演化规则。\n\n其他 Amadeus 插件均为可选联动，按需要分别安装。"
    },
    {
      "section": "界面",
      "text": "截图展示已有界面，不表示本轮所有真实平台能力均已通过。具体限制请阅读配置参考和验收报告。"
    },
    {
      "section": "升级与回滚",
      "text": "升级前备份用户数据。程序、持久数据和恢复备份分开保存。禁用停止功能；卸载默认保留外部数据。回退旧程序不能自动撤销数据库迁移。\n\n- [升级政策](docs/UPGRADE_POLICY.md)\n- [数据迁移与恢复](docs/DATA_MIGRATION.md)\n- [发行检查清单](docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md)\n- [完整配置与限制](REFERENCE.md)\n\n[项目主页](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/Amadeus-dsh) · [MIT 许可证](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
